guild-creation-progress
PASS: newly created guild has level 1 and database-derived next experience before first save; GS_LEVEL is persisted

guild-permission-refresh
PASS: member position changes and permission grants/revocations refresh affected online members only

guild-storage-cart-lock
PASS: locked cart transfers close without mutations; unlocked transfers succeed; invalid requests do not mutate; member positions stay within bounds

guild-management-authority
PASS: guild leader cannot leave; alliance replies require exact pending inviter and current authority

guild-membership-clear
PASS: unrelated guild members and valid joins retain membership; only removed memberships clear pending alliances

guild-membership-persistence
PASS: leave updates the character cache; position, experience and leadership changes retain new membership until SQL persistence
